  "judgment": {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "reasoning": "All six earlier answers are confirmed by their own captured worked solutions. The source defines the geometric distribution on X=1,2,..., so P(X=k)=p(1-p)^(k-1) and P(X≥k)=(1-p)^(k-1). Thus q-97127 gives 0.15(0.85)^6=0.05657242734375, rounded to 0.0566; q-130031 gives 0.4(0.6)^4=0.05184, rounded to 0.0518; q-130196 gives P(X=1)+P(X=2)=0.15+0.1275=0.2775; q-97155 includes exactly X=4,5,6 and gives (0.77)^3-(0.77)^6=0.248110619911, rounded to 0.2481; q-130236 gives (1/3)^5=1/243, rounded to 0.0041; and q-130233 gives (2/5)^4=0.0256. No mathematical answer disagreements occur in this current subset. The earlier batch's source error concerned q-51405, which is absent here.",
